{#- How it works (#1398, 17 Nov 2026), the page shootpick.com's how-it-works
    and integrations pages add up to, in Prospektor's words: the one
    sentence (it sits on top of your CRM), the flow in one row, three
    numbered steps each with a drawn preview, the CRM picker with the setup
    steps the studio's own help gives (docs/help/articles/connect-apps.md),
    five questions and the close. It took Demo's place in the header; the
    demo stays one link under the scan field and one more below. Nothing
    here is a screenshot: every frame is drawn example content, the cast
    the rest of the site uses. -#}
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <span class="tag">{% t %}How it works{% endt %}</span>
    <h1 class="page-h1">{% t %}Prospektor sits on top of your CRM.{% endt %}</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">{% t %}It does not replace anything. It finds the companies that fit, works out who decides and what to say, and sends each one into the CRM you already run.{% endt %}</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="flowrow" aria-label="{{ 'How Prospektor feeds your CRM' | t }}">
  <div class="flowrow-in">
    <ol>
      <li><div class="fr-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg><strong>{% t %}What you sell{% endt %}</strong><span>{% t %}Your site, your best customers, a competitor{% endt %}</span></div><svg class="fr-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></li>
      <li><div class="fr-box hub"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-4-4"/></svg><strong>Prospektor</strong><span>{% t %}Finds the companies that fit, the people who decide, the first email{% endt %}</span></div><svg class="fr-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></li>
      <li><div class="fr-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 6v12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6"/><path d="M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"/></svg><strong>{% t %}Your CRM{% endt %}</strong><span class="fr-logos">{%- for c in ['hubspot', 'salesforce', 'attio', 'close', 'affinity', 'lightfield', 'highlevel'] %}<img src="{{ ('/assets/img/integrations/' + c + '.svg') | asset }}" alt="" width="18" height="18">{%- endfor %}</span></div><svg class="fr-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></li>
      <li><div class="fr-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18h5v-4h5v-4h6"/><path d="m17 7 3 3-3 3"/></svg><strong>{% t %}Your sales process{% endt %}</strong><span>{% t %}Stages, tasks and follow-up, unchanged{% endt %}</span></div></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="fr-note">{% t %}Prospektor writes a company, its people, a deal and a note. Push again and the same records update. Your stages and fields stay yours.{% endt %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hs band" style="margin-top:96px" id="steps">
  <div class="col home-col" style="display:grid;gap:80px">
    <div class="row2">
      <div class="txt">
        <p class="n">01</p>
        <h3>{% t %}Tell it what you sell.{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Give it your website and it works out who you sell to. Point it at your best customers, a competitor, a list from a conference or the people you know, and it looks for more companies like them.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="shotp" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="shot">
          <span class="small">{% t %}What you sell{% endt %}</span>
          <div class="scanf">ledgerpost.com<b>{% t %}Find my leads{% endt %}</b></div>
          <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5"><b style="font-weight:600">Ledgerpost</b> {% t %}sells customs software to freight forwarders above 100,000 shipments a year. Worth hunting: forwarders in the Benelux who still file by hand.{% endt %}</p>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px"><span class="pill">{% t %}Like Northwind{% endt %}</span><span class="pill">{% t %}A competitor’s customers{% endt %}</span><span class="pill">{% t %}Multimodal 2026 exhibitors{% endt %}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row2 flip">
      <div class="shotp" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="shot">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="lg o" style="width:36px;height:36px;font-size:15px">C</span><span class="nm"><b style="font-size:15px">Calder Shipping Group</b><span>calder-shipping.com · Rotterdam</span></span><span class="fit" style="font-size:24px">84</span></div>
          <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5">{% t %}Nine people retype customs filings by hand, and their investor update names customs delay as the top drag on margin.{% endt %}</p>
          <div class="lead" style="margin-top:4px"><span class="lg b">M</span><span class="nm"><b>Marieke de Vries</b><span>{% t %}COO · LinkedIn · work email found{% endt %}</span></span><span class="pill">{% t %}Write to{% endt %}</span></div>
          <div class="lead"><span class="lg v">J</span><span class="nm"><b>Jonas Albers</b><span>{% t %}Head of Customs · LinkedIn{% endt %}</span></span></div>
          <div class="note"><span class="small">{% t %}Cold email{% endt %}</span>{% t %}Marieke, you already hold the filing data for 11 of your 14 ports. Worth twenty minutes to try one?{% endt %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="txt">
        <p class="n">02</p>
        <h3>{% t %}It finds the fit and writes the pitch.{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Each company gets a score with the reasons on both sides, the names of the people who decide, and a first email in your voice. Wins and losses you record sharpen the next one.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row2">
      <div class="txt">
        <p class="n">03</p>
        <h3>{% t %}One press, and it is in your pipeline.{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Prospektor writes the company, its people, a deal in your first stage and a note with the fit and the angle. From there your team works the way it always has.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="shotp" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="shot">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/hubspot.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="22" height="22"><b style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">HubSpot</b><span class="pill dark" style="margin-left:auto">{% t %}Push to HubSpot{% endt %}</span></div>
          <div class="kv" style="gap:8px;margin-top:6px">
            <div><span>{% t %}Company{% endt %}</span><b>Calder Shipping Group</b></div>
            <div><span>{% t %}Contacts{% endt %}</span><b>Marieke de Vries, Jonas Albers</b></div>
            <div><span>{% t %}Deal{% endt %}</span><b>{% t %}New · Pilot on the Rotterdam lane{% endt %}</b></div>
            <div><span>{% t %}Note{% endt %}</span><b>{% t %}Fit 84, the reasons and the angle{% endt %}</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- Pick your CRM: one button per CRM the studio connects, the setup panel
    for the one pressed (pick.js). The steps are the help's own, with the
    one difference per CRM the help names: HubSpot, Close and Salesforce
    approve on their own screen, the others take a pasted key. -#}
<section class="hs" id="connect">
  <div class="col home-col">
    <div style="margin-bottom:40px">
      <h2 class="sec-h2" style="margin-bottom:14px">{% t %}Pick your CRM.<br>Connected in a minute.{% endt %}</h2>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;color:var(--ink-mid)">{% t %}Choose the one you run to see the setup.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>
    {%- set crms = [
      ['hubspot', 'HubSpot', 'oauth'], ['salesforce', 'Salesforce', 'oauth'], ['attio', 'Attio', 'key'],
      ['close', 'Close', 'oauth'], ['affinity', 'Affinity', 'key'], ['lightfield', 'Lightfield', 'key'],
      ['highlevel', 'HighLevel', 'key']
    ] %}
    <div class="pick" data-pick>
      <ul class="pick-list" role="tablist" aria-label="{{ 'Your CRM' | t }}">
        {%- for c in crms %}
        <li><button type="button" role="tab" id="pick-{{ c[0] }}" aria-controls="setup-{{ c[0] }}" aria-selected="{{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }}"><img src="{{ ('/assets/img/integrations/' + c[0] + '.svg') | asset }}" alt="" width="22" height="22">{{ c[1] }}</button></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- for c in crms %}
      <div class="setup" role="tabpanel" id="setup-{{ c[0] }}" aria-labelledby="pick-{{ c[0] }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>
        <span class="small">{% t %}Setup{% endt %}</span>
        <h3>{{ c[1] }}</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><i>1</i><div><b>{% t %}Open Settings, then Connectors{% endt %}</b><span>{% t %}Each app has a tile that says whether it is connected.{% endt %}</span></div></li>
          {%- if c[2] == 'oauth' %}
          <li><i>2</i><div><b>{% t %}Press the tile and approve Prospektor{% endt %}</b><span>{% t %}The CRM asks on its own screen. Nothing to paste.{% endt %}{% if c[0] == 'salesforce' %} {% t %}Your Salesforce admin installs the Prospektor app first; ask us for the install link.{% endt %}{% endif %}</span></div></li>
          {%- else %}
          <li><i>2</i><div><b>{% t %}Paste a key and press Connect{% endt %}</b><span>{% t %}The key comes from your CRM’s own settings. The tile says where.{% endt %}</span></div></li>
          {%- endif %}
          <li><i>3</i><div><b>{% t %}Push a finished pitch{% endt %}</b><span>{% t %}Every pitch has a Push to button named after your CRM, beside Share.{% endt %}
            {% if c[0] == 'hubspot' %}{% t %}It writes a Company, its Contacts, a Deal in your first stage and a Note.{% endt %}
            {%- elif c[0] == 'salesforce' %}{% t %}It writes an Account, its Contacts, an Opportunity and a Note.{% endt %}
            {%- elif c[0] == 'attio' %}{% t %}It writes a Company, the people with a work email and a dated Note.{% endt %}
            {%- elif c[0] == 'close' %}{% t %}It writes a Lead, its Contacts, an Opportunity and a Note.{% endt %}
            {%- elif c[0] == 'affinity' %}{% t %}It writes the Organization onto the list you pick, with its people and a Note.{% endt %}
            {%- elif c[0] == 'lightfield' %}{% t %}It writes an Account, the contacts with a work email, an Opportunity and a Note.{% endt %}
            {%- else %}{% t %}It writes a Contact for each person with a work email, tagged prospektor, and a Note.{% endt %}{% endif %}</span></div></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="note">{% t %}One CRM at a time. Pushing the same pitch again adds no second company or person. Disconnect stops it at once; what it already sent stays in your CRM.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin:28px 0 0;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-mid)">{% t %}Slack, your own Claude or ChatGPT and a token for anything else are on the{% endt %} <a href="{{ '/integrations/' | localize }}">{% t %}integrations page{% endt %}</a>. <a href="{{ '/demo/' | localize }}">{% t %}Or click through the demo.{% endt %}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/pick.js' | asset }}" defer></script>

<section class="hs band">
  <div class="col home-col">
    <h2 class="sec-h2" style="text-align:center">{% t %}Questions.{% endt %}</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details open><summary>{% t %}Does it replace my CRM?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}No. Your pipeline, stages, tasks and follow-up stay where they are. Prospektor only adds the companies that fit, with their people and a note, and your team works them as before.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}What exactly does a push write?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}A company, its people, a deal in your first stage and a note with the fit and the angle. Push again and the same records update; nothing is duplicated.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}Can I bring my own list?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}Yes. Drop a spreadsheet of companies, or paste a page that lists them, and each one comes back scored.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}Can my own Claude or ChatGPT do the work?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}Yes. Add one connector address and your own assistant reads a company, writes the pitch and preps the call, with the same sources.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}Where do the names and emails come from?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}Public pages it read, each one linked. Without a source, a role stays a role.{% endt %}</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="close-band">
  <h2>{% t %}Keep your CRM. Add Prospektor.{% endt %}</h2>
  <p>{% t %}Scan your site and see the first three companies, free.{% endt %}</p>
  <a class="btn-cta" href="{{ '/#scan' | localize }}">{% t %}Scan your site{% endt %}</a>
</section>
